  "notable_quotes": [
    "Increasing temperature enhances inverse separation performance, and one-step separation of a 50/50 C2H2/CO2 mixture yields C2H2 product with >99.99% purity at room temperature.",
    "Changing pillar ligand aromaticity shifts behavior from C2H2-selective Zn-MUC-TRZ to partial CO2-selective Zn-FA-TRZ and complete inverse separation in Zn-BDC-TRZ.",
    "In fixed-bed breakthrough tests, Zn-FA-TRZ and Zn-MUC-TRZ remain C2H2-selective, whereas Zn-BDC-TRZ exhibits prominent CO2-selective inverse C2H2/CO2 separation."
